---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About || Roofing Services Website Template" description="RoofPro Services is a modern and professional roofing service template designed for roofing companies, contractors, and construction businesses.">
  <Header />

  <main class="main-wrapper">
    <!-- Breadcrumb Section -->
    <section class="section_breadcrumb">
      <div class="section-gap hero">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
          <div class="breadcrumb-wrapper">
            <div class="breadcrumb-link-block">
              <a href="/" class="link-button text-color-white w-inline-block">
                <div class="link-button-icon w-embed">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M19 12H5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    <path d="M12 5L5 12L12 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="button-text">Back to Home</div>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="breadcrumb-content-block max-width-708">
              <div class="breadcrumb-subtitle-block">
                <div class="breadcrumb-subtitle">About Us</div>
              </div>
              <div class="breadcrumb-title-block">
                <h1 class="heading-style-2 text-color-white">Building excellence in roofing solutions for over two decades</h1>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Story Section -->
    <section class="section_our-story">
      <div class="section-gap">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
          <div data-w-id="8cb816be-0f76-b21e-60a1-a224399d1a40" class="our-story-wrapper">
            <div data-w-id="8cb816be-0f76-b21e-60a1-a224399d1a42" class="our-story-left-block animate-on-scroll">
              <h2>Our Story</h2>
            </div>
            <div data-w-id="8cb816be-0f76-b21e-60a1-a224399d1a41" class="our-story-right-block animate-on-scroll">
              <div class="our-story-content-block" style="position: relative;">
                
                <!-- Background Dashed Line Track & Animated Blue Line -->
                <div class="our-story-liner-block">
                  <div class="our-story-ht-liner" style="transform: scaleY(0); transform-origin: top center;"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2018 Point -->
                <div class="our-story-point-block">
                  <div class="our-story-point-heading-block">
                    <div class="our-story-point-title-block">
                      <div class="paragraph-large text-weight-semi-bold title-text-color">2018</div>
                      <p class="paragraph-small title-text-color text-weight-semi-bold">Office Setup</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-point-icon-block">
                      <div class="our-story-point-icon w-embed">
                        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <g clip-path="url(#clip0_4125_258)">
                            <path d="M28.3334 11.667L11.6667 28.3337" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            <path d="M13.3334 11.667H28.3334V26.667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                          </g>
                          <defs>
                            <clipPath id="clip0_4125_258">
                              <rect width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)"></rect>
                            </clipPath>
                          </defs>
                        </svg>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-pointer-block is-1">
                      <div class="our-story-pointer is-1"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="our-story-point-summary-block">
                    <p class="paragraph-small top-pd-main">
                      Founded in 2018, our roofing company began with a simple mission: to provide Brisbane homeowners and businesses with honest, high-quality roofing services they could trust. What started as a small family-run operation has grown into one of the region's most respected roofing contractors.<br /><br />
                      Over the past 8 years, we've completed more than 500 projects, from simple residential repairs to complex commercial installations. Our success is built on a foundation of exceptional craftsmanship, transparent pricing, and genuine care for our clients' needs. Today, we're proud to lead the industry with innovative roofing solutions, sustainable practices, and a team of certified professionals who share our commitment to excellence. Every roof we install or repair is a testament to our dedication to protecting what matters most to our clients.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2020 Point -->
                <div class="our-story-point-block">
                  <div class="our-story-point-heading-block">
                    <div class="our-story-point-title-block">
                      <div class="paragraph-large text-weight-semi-bold title-text-color">2020</div>
                      <p class="paragraph-small title-text-color text-weight-semi-bold">Award Winning</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-point-icon-block">
                      <div class="our-story-point-icon w-embed">
                        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <g clip-path="url(#clip0_4125_258)">
                            <path d="M28.3334 11.667L11.6667 28.3337" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            <path d="M13.3334 11.667H28.3334V26.667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                          </g>
                          <defs>
                            <clipPath id="clip0_4125_258">
                              <rect width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)"></rect>
                            </clipPath>
                          </defs>
                        </svg>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-pointer-block is-2">
                      <div class="our-story-pointer is-2"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="our-story-point-summary-block">
                    <p class="paragraph-small top-pd-main">
                      In 2020, our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction was officially recognized when we received multiple industry awards for excellence in roofing services. These achievements reflected not only our technical expertise but also our dedication to delivering projects on time and within budget.<br /><br />
                      The recognition strengthened our reputation across Brisbane and surrounding regions, helping us build stronger partnerships with suppliers, contractors, and commercial clients. It also motivated our team to continuously raise the bar in craftsmanship, safety standards, and innovative roofing solutions.<br /><br />
                      Winning these awards was more than a milestone — it was proof that our values of integrity, reliability, and precision set us apart in a competitive market.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2025 Point -->
                <div class="our-story-point-block">
                  <div class="our-story-point-heading-block">
                    <div class="our-story-point-title-block">
                      <div class="paragraph-large text-weight-semi-bold title-text-color">2025</div>
                      <p class="paragraph-small title-text-color text-weight-semi-bold">Rescale Office</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-point-icon-block">
                      <div class="our-story-point-icon w-embed">
                        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <g clip-path="url(#clip0_4125_258)">
                            <path d="M28.3334 11.667L11.6667 28.3337" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            <path d="M13.3334 11.667H28.3334V26.667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                          </g>
                          <defs>
                            <clipPath id="clip0_4125_258">
                              <rect width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)"></rect>
                            </clipPath>
                          </defs>
                        </svg>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-pointer-block is-3">
                      <div class="our-story-pointer is-3"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="our-story-point-summary-block">
                    <p class="paragraph-small top-pd-main">
                      By 2025, the rapid growth of our operations required a larger and more advanced workspace. We expanded and relocated to a modern office facility designed to support our growing team and streamline project management processes.<br /><br />
                      The new office allowed us to enhance internal collaboration, invest in upgraded technology, and improve overall operational efficiency. With a dedicated client consultation space and improved logistics coordination, we were able to deliver an even smoother service experience from initial inquiry to project completion.<br /><br />
                      This expansion marked a significant step forward, positioning us for long-term scalability and stronger service coverage across the region.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2026 Point -->
                <div class="our-story-point-block">
                  <div class="our-story-point-heading-block">
                    <div class="our-story-point-title-block">
                      <div class="paragraph-large text-weight-semi-bold title-text-color">2026</div>
                      <p class="paragraph-small title-text-color text-weight-semi-bold">Reconstruction</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-point-icon-block">
                      <div class="our-story-point-icon w-embed">
                        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                          <g clip-path="url(#clip0_4125_258)">
                            <path d="M28.3334 11.667L11.6667 28.3337" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            <path d="M13.3334 11.667H28.3334V26.667" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                          </g>
                          <defs>
                            <clipPath id="clip0_4125_258">
                              <rect width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)"></rect>
                            </clipPath>
                          </defs>
                        </svg>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-pointer-block is-4">
                      <div class="our-story-pointer is-4"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="our-story-point-summary-block">
                    <p class="paragraph-small top-pd-main">
                      In 2026, we undertook a major reconstruction initiative focused on innovation and structural excellence. This phase represented our evolution from a traditional roofing contractor to a comprehensive roofing solutions provider.<br /><br />
                      We integrated advanced materials, sustainable building practices, and modern engineering techniques into our services. Our reconstruction projects showcased our ability to handle complex structural upgrades, full roof replacements, and large-scale commercial restorations with precision and durability.<br /><br />
                      This milestone reaffirmed our mission: to protect, strengthen, and future-proof every property we work on while maintaining the highest standards of workmanship and client care.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Purpose Section -->
    <section class="section_our-purpose">
      <div class="section-gap">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
          <div class="our-purpose-wrapper">
            <div class="section-heading-block">
              <div class="section-title-block max-width-250">
                <h2 class="heading-style-2">What <span class="heading-style-2-ht">Drives Us</span></h2>
